+/**
+ * @fileoverview Post-Quantum, Hybrid, and Classical Key Establishment & Authenticated Encryption
+ * Engine for Browser & WebCrypto Environments ("The Daily Grind" Quantum-Safe Security Layer).
+ *
+ * Implements:
+ * 1. ML-KEM-768 (NIST FIPS 203 Module-Lattice-Based Key-Encapsulation Mechanism)
+ *    - Automatically uses native WebCrypto `ML-KEM-768` (`encapsulateBits`/`decapsulateBits`) when
+ *      supported by the runtime, or seamlessly falls back to the built-in pure-JS FIPS 203 engine
+ *      (Ring R_q = Z_q[X]/(X^256 + 1), q = 3329, k = 3, eta_1 = 2, eta_2 = 2, d_u = 10, d_v = 4)
+ *      with SHA-3 / SHAKE (FIPS 202 Keccak-f[1600]) so it works in 100% of browsers.
+ * 2. Classical Key Agreement & Encapsulation via Web Crypto API (`window.crypto.subtle`):
+ *    - X25519 (RFC 7748 Elliptic Curve Diffie-Hellman)
+ *    - ECDH P-256 (NIST SP 800-56A Rev. 3)
+ *    - RSA-OAEP-256 (RFC 8017 / NIST SP 800-56B Rev. 2 Key Encapsulation)
