+ *    - Combines classical ECDH shared secret `ss_classical` with post-quantum ML-KEM-768 shared secret `ss_pq`
+ *    - Binds public keys and ciphertexts into the HKDF-SHA256 transcript (`info` & `salt`) to prevent
+ *      cross-protocol and downgrade attacks.
+ * 4. Authenticated Encryption with Associated Data (AEAD):
+ *    - AES-256-GCM (96-bit CSPRNG nonce, 128-bit authentication tag, structured AAD binding)
+ *    - Tamper detection and replay/context-substitution defense via AAD verification.
